{"2736220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GUNCHO", "steam_appid": 2736220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3070900], "detailed_description": "<h1>Is this game for me?</h1><p>If you are looking for a pocket sized but highly replayable turn-based tactics game with a unique core mechanic, Guncho is for you.<br><br>A full run of Guncho can be played in about 30 minutes, featuring the “Burning Desert” biome, with various enemy types and a fierce end-boss.<br><br>We're three self-funded independent game creators—Arnold, Terri, and Sam—and we have many ideas on how to expand Guncho further post launch, with your support.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/4c5195fff758675f468fee687e444c76.avif?t=1726559149\" width=599 height=99 /></span><br><br>Guncho's core mechanic is based on a unique shooting mechanic. By moving, shooting, and unloading bullets, you influence Guncho's revolver cylinder rotation. To outwit your enemies, align your bullets with the hex-grid through clever tactical moves.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/9388d0b96b37c904dc79dc56973a9d89.poster.avif?t=1726559149\" width=600 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/9388d0b96b37c904dc79dc56973a9d89.webm?t=1726559149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/9388d0b96b37c904dc79dc56973a9d89.mp4?t=1726559149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can also use the environment to overcome the challenges of each level by targeting explosive barrels or pushing your foes into fire or deadly cacti.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/2a5a2bc70c5aa302a3aa0607bd1204a8.poster.avif?t=1726559149\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/2a5a2bc70c5aa302a3aa0607bd1204a8.webm?t=1726559149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/2a5a2bc70c5aa302a3aa0607bd1204a8.mp4?t=1726559149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After each level, choose from a variety of bullet upgrades and skills to further improve your tactical abilities. In each run, you face a final boss that will test your skills and tactical finesse.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/cce248fcf9090576da4dc72068e5fc34.avif?t=1726559149\" width=599 height=102 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique positional shooting mechanic.<br></li><li> Turn-based Wild West roguelike shootouts.<br></li><li> Hex-based tactics gameplay.<br></li><li> Randomly generated levels.<br></li><li> A variety of enemy types, with different movement and skill sets.<br></li><li> Easy and Expert game modes.<br></li><li> Daily game challenge.<br></li><li> Unlocks and Achievements.<br></li><li> Steam Cloud saves.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/f93a970ce565ad06beddb4f84ee0b88b.avif?t=1726559149\" width=599 height=161 /></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/4c5195fff758675f468fee687e444c76.avif?t=1726559149\" width=599 height=99 /></span><br><br>Guncho's core mechanic is based on a unique shooting mechanic. By moving, shooting, and unloading bullets, you influence Guncho's revolver cylinder rotation. To outwit your enemies, align your bullets with the hex-grid through clever tactical moves.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/9388d0b96b37c904dc79dc56973a9d89.poster.avif?t=1726559149\" width=600 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/9388d0b96b37c904dc79dc56973a9d89.webm?t=1726559149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/9388d0b96b37c904dc79dc56973a9d89.mp4?t=1726559149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can also use the environment to overcome the challenges of each level by targeting explosive barrels or pushing your foes into fire or deadly cacti.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/2a5a2bc70c5aa302a3aa0607bd1204a8.poster.avif?t=1726559149\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/2a5a2bc70c5aa302a3aa0607bd1204a8.webm?t=1726559149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/2a5a2bc70c5aa302a3aa0607bd1204a8.mp4?t=1726559149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After each level, choose from a variety of bullet upgrades and skills to further improve your tactical abilities. In each run, you face a final boss that will test your skills and tactical finesse.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/cce248fcf9090576da4dc72068e5fc34.avif?t=1726559149\" width=599 height=102 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique positional shooting mechanic.<br></li><li> Turn-based Wild West roguelike shootouts.<br></li><li> Hex-based tactics gameplay.<br></li><li> Randomly generated levels.<br></li><li> A variety of enemy types, with different movement and skill sets.<br></li><li> Easy and Expert game modes.<br></li><li> Daily game challenge.<br></li><li> Unlocks and Achievements.<br></li><li> Steam Cloud saves.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/extras/f93a970ce565ad06beddb4f84ee0b88b.avif?t=1726559149\" width=599 height=161 /></span>", "short_description": "In this small scale, turn based tactics game, you spin Guncho's revolver cylinder to keep his bullets aligned to enemies. Fight your way through randomly generated shootouts. Upgrade your bullets and use tactical abilities to defeat your foes. Ride your donkey and become the ultimate Pistolero.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/header.jpg?t=1726559149", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726559149", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1726559149", "website": "http://www.guncho-game.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 Gb Video Memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 7.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 G